          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 81,
              "Title": "We’re delighted to have you with us!",
              "Text": "_Check-in_ is available from **3:00 PM** and check-out is until **11:00 AM**. Should you wish to arrange an early check-in or late check-out, please contact the front desk in advance; we’ll do our best to accommodate your schedule.\n\n**24-Hour Front Desk & Concierge**\n\n\nOur reception desk never closes. **Dial 0** at any time for:\n- Luggage storage or extra pillows, linens, toiletries\n- Restaurant reservations and local recommendations\n- Tickets to shows, tours or special events\n\n\n**Transportation Services**\n\n\nWe offer an airport shuttle service - please contact reception 24 hours in advance to book your transfer. Taxis can be arranged at any time by dialing 0. Public transit stops are within walking distance, and our concierge is happy to assist with directions or car rental arrangements.\n\n\nYour comfort and convenience are our top priorities - if there’s anything you need, just let us know.\n\n",
              "Media": null,
              "Photoslider": null
            }
          ]
