          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 82,
              "Title": "Connect to our WiFi",
              "Text": "Stay connected throughout your visit with our complimentary Wi-Fi. Network name and password are displayed here and can also be found on the card in your room wallet. Should you experience any issues logging on, simply reboot your device or contact reception for support.\n\n\n#### **WiFi name:** Suji Resort\n\n#### **Password:** sujiresort2025\n\nOur high-speed broadband allows you to stream, browse and video-call with ease. For business guests we provide secure access to VPN services and printing facilities; just ask at reception for any assistance or additional login credentials.",
              "Media": null,
              "Photoslider": null
            }
          ]
