          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 83,
              "Title": "Start your day right with our breakfast offering",
              "Text": "Our breakfast service is available in the main restaurant **from 7 am to 10 am Monday to Friday** and **until 11 am at the weekend**. Indulge in a plentiful buffet of freshly baked pastries, seasonal fruit, an array of cereals and creamy yoghurts. \n\n\nAlternatively, choose from our à la carte menu, where you can enjoy eggs cooked to your preference, back bacon, classic sausages and chargrilled tomatoes. Complement your meal with freshly brewed coffee, a selection of fine teas and a glass of freshly squeezed juice.\n\n\nIf you have any dietary requirements or special requests - **vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free** or otherwise - simply let a member of our team know and we’ll be delighted to assist. We look forward to helping you start the day just the way you like it.",
              "Media": null,
              "Photoslider": null
            }
          ]
